---
import CloseModalBtn from "./CloseModalBtn.astro";
---

<div class="project-details">
  <h2>Origeo App Offline</h2>

  <p>
    Origeo App Offline is a mobile application available on the Google Play
    Store, designed to deliver a seamless user experience even without internet
    connectivity. This project ensures that users can access essential features
    and content anytime, anywhere.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
    Company: Globant | ORÍGEO <br />
    Role: Web UI Developer <br />
    Period: September 2024 – December 2024
  </p>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <h3>Technical Overview</h3>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Frontend Development:</strong> Developed and maintained using
      <strong>React Native</strong> to deliver a robust offline experience, ensuring
      smooth and responsive interactions.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Maintenance & Enhancements:</strong> Tasked with maintaining the application,
      fixing bugs, and implementing new features to continuously improve the user
      experience.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Client Collaboration:</strong> Participated in daily meetings with
      the client to report progress and gather feedback for new implementations.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <h3>Development Process</h3>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Requirement Analysis & Planning:</strong> Collaborated with the client
      to understand their needs and plan the necessary enhancements.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Implementation & Maintenance:</strong> Utilized React Native to address
      bugs, roll out new features, and ensure a smooth, intuitive user interface.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Continuous Improvement:</strong> Engaged in daily communications with
      the client to iterate on the product and promptly address issues or suggestions.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="w-full bg-gray-400 h-[1px] my-5 md:my-10"></div>

  <p class="mb-4">Key Skill: React Native, Figma.</p>

  <p>
    Origeo App Offline reflects my commitment to delivering high-quality mobile
    solutions through meticulous maintenance and innovative feature development,
    ensuring users enjoy a seamless and efficient offline experience.
  </p>

  <a
    class="button--primary mt-10"
    href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.origeoapp.offline"
    target="_blank">Project App link</a
  >

  <CloseModalBtn />
</div>
